      "widgets_values": [
        "EverAnimate / WanVideoWrapper_jc\n\nSelect a reference image and preprocessed pose / face videos.\nWan2.2-Animate-14B + stage2_480p, LoRA strength 1.\nEuler, 20 steps, CFG 1, shift 5. Two 77-frame chunks -> 150 frames.\nUse all jc model / VAE / text nodes. CLIP Vision is refreshed internally.\nThe wrapper T5 loader uses the plain umt5-xxl-enc model.\nThis sampler includes decoding; connect images directly to Video Combine."
      ]
